Error [E0302]: (after: Int, before: Int) has no member `missing`
  --> tuple_destructure_unknown_member.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     { before, missing: tail } :: (before: 10, after: 20)
    |               ^^^^^^^
 Why: A record pattern on a tuple can only name the tuple's members
 Fix: Use one of its members: `after` and `before`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0302
